                "text": "Thanks to Republicans\u2019 Big, Ugly Bill, our state is facing a $400 Million loss. That means health care, schools, and other critical services are at risk.\n\nI'll continue to do all I can to help Delawareans get the resources they need.\n\nhttps://t.co/eKqeMnrMRL",
