                "retweet_count": 11,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Energy costs are up\nHousing costs are up\nFood costs are up\nAnd soon, health care costs will skyrocket. \n\nThe President said on day one he would lower costs, but the reality is he's making things more expensive for everyone.",
