                "retweet_count": 31,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Just this year, Republicans\u2026\n\n-Cut funding for SNAP, and now are trying to use hungry families as political leverage\n\n-Cut funding for affordable health care, and now are trying to use higher premiums as political leverage\n\nThey're playing politics with people's lives.",
