                "reply_count": 17,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "With open enrollment underway and premiums set to skyrocket, I met with health care advocates in Wilmington to discuss the impacts they're seeing in our state.\n\nWe must act to end this health care crisis, reform our insurance system, and lower costs.\n\nDelawareans can't wait. https://t.co/1ggLrl1sKy",
