                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 75,
                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "People are already feeling the pain of higher grocery bills, housing costs, and energy costs\u2014 they can't afford the cost of health care skyrocketing even further.\n\u00a0\nThey thought Trump's 'Golden Age' meant affordable gold plans, but all they got was an outrageous golden ballroom. https://t.co/evk6wjkMeQ",
